      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MILE A MINUTE (1) has a strong record this track and trip with 21 wins and nine placings from 32 starts. Below best last time at Geelong (23.15) in a Grade 4/5, finishing a 11 length fourth. Looks suited and should go close. ESPECIAL KAI (7) boasts a strong record this journey with 14 wins and 16 minors from 37 tries. Placed last time (19.28) at this track in a Free For All, finishing third and beaten 3 lengths. With even luck and a clean start should be thereabouts. GALENTO (4) is a talented type and proved too strong last time to win by 0.8 lengths at Sandown in a handy 29.59 beating Giacomo. The form out of the last run is proven to be strong. Can make it two on the bounce. EVIL EYE (6) form at this distance reads well.",
